---
system: sys-13-security-secrets-management
flow_id: secrets-cache-fetch
surface: internal-RPC
spec_anchor: /software/systems/13-security-secrets-management#secrets-caching-implementation
actors: [BackendService, SecretsCache, SecretsManager, CloudWatch]
apis: []
externals: [SecretsManager, CloudWatch]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - secrets_manager_unavailable_no_cache
  - secret_not_found
  - cache_stale_fallback
  - cache_warmup_failed
idempotency: get(secretName) is cached per process — TTL 5 minutes (configurable)
retry: caller-side retry on cache_warmup_failed; stale-fallback masks transient SM outages
timeout: 5s p99 GetSecretValue
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BackendService
    participant SecretsCache
    participant SecretsManager
    participant CloudWatch

    Note over BackendService,SecretsCache: startup warmup — fail-fast if any critical secret unreachable
    BackendService->>SecretsCache: warmup(['tbot/providers/deepgram', 'tbot/providers/anthropic', 'tbot/database/primary'])
    alt cache_warmup_failed
        SecretsCache-->>BackendService: Error("Failed to warm secrets cache for: ...")
        Note over BackendService: process exits — orchestrator restarts pod
    else success
        SecretsCache-->>BackendService: void
    end

    BackendService->>SecretsCache: get("tbot/providers/deepgram")
    alt cache_hit (< 5 min old)
        SecretsCache-->>BackendService: cached value (zero SM calls)
    else cache_miss_or_expired
        SecretsCache->>SecretsManager: GetSecretValue {SecretId}
        alt secret_not_found
            SecretsManager-->>SecretsCache: ResourceNotFoundException
            SecretsCache-->>BackendService: throw Error
        else secrets_manager_unavailable_no_cache
            SecretsManager--xSecretsCache: 5xx / throttle / network timeout
            SecretsCache-->>BackendService: throw Error("Failed to fetch and no cached value available")
        else cache_stale_fallback
            SecretsManager--xSecretsCache: 5xx — but stale entry exists
            SecretsCache->>CloudWatch: emit secretsCacheFallbackTotal{secret_name}
            SecretsCache-->>BackendService: stale value and warning metric
        else success
            SecretsManager-->>SecretsCache: SecretString
            SecretsCache->>SecretsCache: update cache {value, fetchedAt=now}, TTL 5min
            SecretsCache-->>BackendService: fresh value
        end
    end

    Note over BackendService,SecretsCache: forceRefresh(secretName) deletes entry and re-fetches (post-rotation pickup) · clear() on SIGTERM to prevent secrets lingering in memory
